			"notes": "- Added config\n- Added commands to control config\n- Changed apple count to be random from configurable range\n- Changed tick rate of bee attempts to grow leaves to be configurable\n- Bees now require leaves to be exposed to non-solid block to grow\n- Added configuration to override requirements for leaves to be exposed\n- Replaced access wideners/transformers with accessors/invokers\n- Fixed waterlogging state not being transferred\n- Fixed persistent state being overwritten with waterlogging state on shearing\n- Removed logger\n- Revived 1.19-1.19.2 support\n- Forge versions now enabled for all compatible patch subversions\n- Changed icon\n- Forge versions now built with Yarn + Architectury Loom"
		},
